p=Path('docs/performance.md');s=p.read_text()
s=s.replace('Keep SQLite serialization explicit.', 'Keep SQLite serialization explicit through its one worker-owned connection.')
s+='''\nMain-isolate heap measurements are not total worker/process memory. Runtime telemetry also reports process RSS and a sampled SQLite-worker heap gauge; phase-end samples are not peaks. The worker improves isolation while retaining the transaction\'s unavoidable acknowledgement latency. Dense native construction and whole-world serialization remain separate bottlenecks, and the existing callback-gap suspension policy is not replaced by a CPU-utilization guess.\n'''
